📁 app/
Type: Application folder (simulated)

Purpose: This is your actual software installation.

During update, this folder is:

Backed up

Deleted

Replaced by extracted files from the new update

📄 Contains: version.txt, your app scripts, binaries, etc.

📁 backup/
Type: Auto-created folder

Purpose: Stores backup copies of the app/ before updates.

Each backup is named like:

